    "detailed_description": "Joan goes through tough times at school. She has a hard time integrating herself with her classmates. It doesn\u2019t feel like she belongs there. <br>When she falls for Rachel, everything changes. But Rachel\u2019s hiding a deadly secret that will change Joan\u2019s life forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect?</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A story about a character that suffers from social anxiety disorder, while getting bullied at school.<br></li><li> Retro 80\u2019s soundtrack by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio.<br></li><li> A typing system to move forward with the story.</li></ul><br><strong>R is for Rachel</strong> feels like reading a novel. It's a single-ending experience with some choices that will help the main character uncover the truth and achieve her goal.<br><br>For fans of text-based story driven games.",
    "about_the_game": "Joan goes through tough times at school. She has a hard time integrating herself with her classmates. It doesn\u2019t feel like she belongs there. <br>When she falls for Rachel, everything changes. But Rachel\u2019s hiding a deadly secret that will change Joan\u2019s life forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect?</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A story about a character that suffers from social anxiety disorder, while getting bullied at school.<br></li><li> Retro 80\u2019s soundtrack by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio.<br></li><li> A typing system to move forward with the story.</li></ul><br><strong>R is for Rachel</strong> feels like reading a novel. It's a single-ending experience with some choices that will help the main character uncover the truth and achieve her goal.<br><br>For fans of text-based story driven games.",
